{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgktCYzrV7WhdeMoKT796","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Me (24, salaried) going through the Harel page\n\n## 1. What I'd do, and how sure I am\n\nI'd move my money into the S&P 500 track. Before reading this I'd have guessed it was the best choice, but the page made me less sure about that.\n\nEvery product has a row called **\"עוקב מדד S&P 500\"**, so I can find \"the S&P 500\" wherever my money is. What I'd do:\n- **Keren hishtalmut:** fee **0.5% \"מהחיסכון\"**. Average yearly return was **13.71%** over 3 years and **11.89%** over 5.\n- **Pension:** I don't know which kind I have, so I can't pick a row yet. It's either **\"קרן חדשה מקיפה\"** or **\"קרן חדשה כללית\"**. In both, the S&P row has about the same 5-year return as the others, around 11%.\n\n**How sure:** about 60%. Two things bother me:\n- The plain **\"מניות\"** track did better than the S&P one. In the hishtalmut it got **21.45%** over 3 years against **13.71%**. In pension כללית it got **21.38%** against **13.67%**. People told me S&P is the smart choice, so why is \"מניות\" ahead? I don't know if I should switch to that instead.\n- I can't tell if 0.5% is a good fee. The page only shows Harel, and I can't see what other companies charge.\n\n## 2. Parts I actually used\n- The **\"כל המוצרים של הראל\"** title and the row of buttons under it. I looked for \"קרן השתלמות 16\" and \"קרן פנסיה\".\n- The big table, mostly the **\"קרן השתלמות\"** group and the two pension groups (**\"קרן חדשה מקיפה\"** and **\"קרן חדשה כללית\"**).\n- The grey line at the top of each group, e.g. **\"16 מסלולים · כסף מנוהל 37.4 מיליארד ₪ · דמי ניהול מהחיסכון: מ־0.41% עד 0.67%\"**. It gave me the range quickly.\n- The small text under the table: **\"התשואה היא תשואה עבר… לפני דמי הניהול ולפני מס\"**.\n\n## 3. Block by block\n- **Top menu (מקור, מדריך, חוקים וכללים…):** skipped.\n- **\"הראל\" title and intro text:** skimmed. I got that the fees are averages from 2025. I didn't understand **\"123 מקור 123 מחושב · לחצו על מספר כדי לראות מאיפה הוא\"**.\n- **Company list (\"הראל פנסיה וגמל בע\"מ · הראל קרנות נאמנות\"):** skimmed and didn't care.\n- **Product buttons:** used them. One thing confused me a bit: the button says **\"כל המוצרים 105\"** but the text below says **\"96 מסלולים ב־7 מוצרים\"**. Which number is right?\n- **\"בתוך כל מוצר, המסלולים מסודרים לפי דמי הניהול מהחיסכון, מהזול ליקר\":** read it. Helpful.\n- **קופת גמל להשקעה:** skimmed. I don't know what this is or if I have one.\n- **קרן השתלמות:** used it a lot.\n- **תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים:** skipped. I don't understand the name.\n- **חיסכון לכל ילד:** skipped. I don't have kids.\n- **קרן חדשה מקיפה / כללית:** used them, but got confused. Which one is mine? What does \"מקיפה\" mean?\n- **מרכזית לפיצויים:** skipped.\n- **Notes with \"PF-06\" and \"PF-10\":** read them half-understanding. \"PF-06\" means nothing to me.\n- **\"קרנות מחקות\" and \"קרנות סל\":** confused me. The fees look tiny (**\"קבועים 0%, משתנים 0.1%, נאמן 0.025%\"**), so is this cheaper than my hishtalmut? But I don't know how you'd even buy one. I also couldn't tell what the tags **\"צוברת\"**, **\"כמה דרכים יחד\"**, **\"מס גם על שינויי המטבע\"** or **\"4A / 4D\"** mean.\n- **\"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\" (closed sections):** skipped.\n- **\"לא מצאתם שם?\" search box:** skipped.\n- **Footer:** skipped. I noticed **\"נתונים נכון ל־03.11.2026\"**, which was nice.\n\n## 4. Inside the table\n**Looked at:**\n- **Track name**, to find \"S&P 500\" and \"מניות\".\n- **\"דמי ניהול… מהחיסכון\"**, the top number in that column.\n- **\"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\"**, both the 3-year and 5-year numbers.\n- **\"כסף מנוהל\"**, only as a feeling that the track is big and safe.\n\n**Glanced at:**\n- The **donut circles** and the **\"מניות\"** percentage next to them. A full circle meant \"all stocks\", which is enough for me.\n- The yellow **\"מט\"ח\"** line. I know it means foreign currency, but not why it matters to me.\n\n**Ignored:**\n- The **\"קופה\"** numbers (15283, 13502…).\n- The **\">\"** arrows.\n- The little grey tags under names, like **\"אג\"ח סחיר\"** and **\"הלכה יהודי\"**.\n- The dotted underlines. I can't tell what they do.\n\n**Frustrating:** many rows just say **\"פחות מ־3 שנים\"**, so there's nothing to compare.\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n- **\"מהחיסכון\"** vs **\"מההפקדה\"**. In pension the second number is **1.47%**, way higher than the **0.16%**. Which one actually costs me more?\n- **\"אין\"** vs **\"0%\"** vs **\"עוד לא דווח\"** in the הפקדה line.\n- **\"קרן חדשה מקיפה\"** vs **\"כללית\"**.\n- **\"סחיר\"**, **\"משולב\"**, **\"גמיש\"**, **\"קיימות\"**.\n- In the fund tables: **\"קבועים / משתנים / נאמן\"**, **\"צוברת\"**, **\"4A / 4D\"**.\n- Why the pension S&P track is only **73% מניות**. Isn't S&P all stocks?\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n- **Which track am I in right now?** And which pension type do I have?\n- **Returns after fees.** The page says the returns are before fees.\n- **Is Harel cheap or expensive** compared with other companies?\n- **How to switch tracks.**\n- **How much the \"הוצאות ישירות\" are.** The note says they come out on top of the fees, but gives no number.\n- **Whether a קרן מחקה is something I should do instead.**\n\n## 7. If half the page had to go, cut first\n1. **\"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\"** sections\n2. **קרנות מחקות** and **קרנות סל** tables (or move them somewhere separate, with an explanation)\n3. Products I'll never use: **מרכזית לפיצויים**, **תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים**, **חיסכון לכל ילד**\n4. The **\"קופה\"** number column and the **\"123 מקור / מחושב\"** line\n5. The **\"לא מצאתם שם?\"** search box\n\n**Keep:** the product buttons, the track name, the fee, and the 3- and 5-year returns."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21537,"cache_read_input_tokens":3648,"cac